            "id": "msg_de832f380a",
            "role": "user",
            "content": "# DeepSeek Agent - Phase 2: Refactor Frontend Architecture Before Migrating Storage\n\nThe audit found:\n\n* 607 localStorage references\n* 79 source files using browser storage\n* PHP + MySQL backend is already production-ready\n* 50+ PHP API endpoints already exist\n\nDo NOT perform a simple search-and-replace of localStorage with fetch().\n\nInstead, redesign the frontend architecture while preserving the UI and user workflows.\n\n## Objective\n\nCreate a clean architecture where every component communicates through a centralized Data Access Layer (DAL).\n\nTarget architecture:\n\nReact Component\n\u2193\n\nCustom Hook\n\n\u2193\n\nService (DAL)\n\n\u2193\n\nPHP API\n\n\u2193\n\nMySQL\n\nThe UI must never directly access:\n\n* localStorage\n* sessionStorage\n* IndexedDB\n* fetch()\n* PDO concepts\n* SQL\n* Browser persistence\n\n---\n\n## Phase 1 - Create Services\n\nCreate a `\/src\/services` directory.\n\nMove all API communication into service modules.\n\nExample:\n\nservices\/\n\npatients.ts\n\nappointments.ts\n\nstaff.ts\n\nusers.ts\n\nprescriptions.ts\n\nclinicalNotes.ts\n\nlanding.ts\n\nsettings.ts\n\npayments.ts\n\ninvestigations.ts\n\nnotifications.ts\n\naudit.ts\n\nEach service should expose only CRUD methods.\n\nExample:\n\ngetAll()\n\ngetById()\n\ncreate()\n\nupdate()\n\ndelete()\n\nsearch()\n\n---\n\n## Phase 2 - Rewrite Hooks\n\nRewrite all shared hooks to use the service layer.\n\nExample:\n\nusePatients()\n\n\u2193\n\npatientService\n\n\u2193\n\nAPI\n\n\u2193\n\nReact Query\n\nNo hook should call localStorage directly.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 3 - Remove Storage Logic From Components\n\nPages and components should never call:\n\nlocalStorage\n\nsessionStorage\n\nfetch()\n\nInstead they should only call hooks or services.\n\nExample:\n\nPatientDashboard\n\n\u2193\n\nusePatients()\n\n\u2193\n\npatientService\n\n\u2193\n\nAPI\n\n\u2193\n\nMySQL\n\nRepeat for:\n\nLanding Page\n\nPatient Profile\n\nAppointments\n\nStaff\n\nSettings\n\nBilling\n\nPrescriptions\n\nClinical Notes\n\nNotifications\n\nAdmin Dashboard\n\nAll dashboards\n\n---\n\n## Phase 4 - Remove Browser Storage\n\nDelete all business-data storage from:\n\nlocalStorage\n\nsessionStorage\n\nIndexedDB\n\nexcept optional UI preferences such as:\n\ntheme\n\nlanguage\n\nsidebar collapsed state\n\ntable preferences\n\nNo patient, staff, appointment, clinical, billing, or authentication data should remain in browser storage.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 5 - Remove Legacy Code\n\nRemove only after the new architecture is working:\n\nclinicalStore.ts\n\ncanisterActors.tsx\n\nuseCanisterSync.ts\n\nuseMigration.ts\n\nhybridStorage.ts\n\nICP backend\n\nMotoko files\n\nDead imports\n\nUnused dependencies\n\n---\n\n## Phase 6 - Standardize API Responses\n\nAll services should use a common API client.\n\nImplement:\n\napiClient.get()\n\napiClient.post()\n\napiClient.put()\n\napiClient.delete()\n\nHandle:\n\nauthentication\n\nerrors\n\ntimeouts\n\nJSON parsing\n\nHTTP status\n\nretry policy\n\nin one location.\n\n---\n\n## Phase 7 - Verification\n\nAfter refactoring:\n\n* No component accesses localStorage.\n* No component performs direct fetch() calls.\n* All CRUD operations use services.\n* All data comes from MySQL.\n* Authentication uses PHP sessions only.\n* The application builds successfully.\n* Existing UI and functionality remain unchanged.\n\nFinally, produce a migration report including:\n\n1. Services created.\n2. Hooks refactored.\n3. Components updated.\n4. Files removed.\n5. Remaining browser storage usage.\n6. Remaining technical debt.\n7. Production readiness score.",
